flowchart TB
 BASE["Baseline generation: units A, B, C"] --> VIEW["Resolve one immutable view"]
 BRANCH["Branch: replace A, delete C<br/>bound to exact baseline"] --> VIEW
 DIRTY["Captured worktree: replace A<br/>bound to exact branch and content digests"] --> VIEW
 VIEW --> MASK["Highest layer mentioning each unit wins<br/>visible: worktree A and baseline B; C absent"]
 MASK --> POLICY["Current project/source scope and endpoint validity"]
 POLICY --> QUERY["Bounded graph, FTS and exact vector candidates<br/>same view and compatible embedding space"]
 BUILD["Idempotent graph / lexical / vector staging batches"] --> SEAL["Verify manifest, references and declared coverage"]
 SEAL --> CAS["Compare expected source and previous pointer"]
 CAS --> PUBLISH["Atomic view pointer + watermark + event"]
 CAS --> STALE["Stale builder: no pointer change"]
 PUBLISH --> PIN["Acquire view pin before derived payload reclamation"]
 PIN --> VIEW
 QUERY --> ACCESS["Recheck current access before snippets / delivery"]
